  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": 0,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 5.78,
      "text": "This is the just announced Samsung Galaxy Z Flip 5. And when you first look at it, it doesn't make any sense.",
      "duration": 5.78,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 1,
      "start_time": 5.96,
      "end_time": 9.76,
      "text": "Compared to Samsung's very highest-end phones, which can be had for, like, the same price now,",
      "duration": 3.8,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 2,
      "start_time": 9.86,
      "end_time": 14.02,
      "text": "every camera is smaller and less capable. You can expect your battery to take longer to charge",
      "duration": 4.16,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 3,
      "start_time": 14.02,
      "end_time": 18.6,
      "text": "and deplete about 20% faster. There's less room for cooling, so the chip won't perform as well.",
      "duration": 4.58,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 4,
      "start_time": 18.7,
      "end_time": 23.1,
      "text": "And yeah, this is more compact. It folds, right? Well, not really.",
      "duration": 4.4,
      "raw_segment_count": 3,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 5,
      "start_time": 23.32,
      "end_time": 28.84,
      "text": "I mean, it is shorter, but it is also thicker. So the actual volume being taken up is about the same.",
      "duration": 5.52,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1137,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 6,
      "start_time": 28.84,
      "end_time": 34.46,
      "text": "And yet, even with all of this, why am I drawn to this Z Flip 5 so much?",
      "duration": 5.62,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 7,
      "start_time": 34.62,
      "end_time": 37.92,
      "text": "Why is it that my curiosity was so sparked when I saw that first one?",
      "duration": 3.3,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 8,
      "start_time": 38.019999999999996,
      "end_time": 41.72,
      "text": "Or that I very nearly switched over to it when I tested the Z Flip 4 last year?",
      "duration": 3.7,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 9,
      "start_time": 41.8,
      "end_time": 47.019999999999996,
      "text": "And that now we have the 5, I've decided that I'm actually going to try and use this thing on a day-to-day basis.",
      "duration": 5.22,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 10,
      "start_time": 47.42,
      "end_time": 51.94,
      "text": "Well, let's start with what's new. The storage has doubled from 128 gigabytes to 256.",
      "duration": 4.52,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 11,
      "start_time": 52.519999999999996,
      "end_time": 55.900000000000006,
      "text": "Although the price has also gone up too, so that's not really a perk.",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 12,
      "start_time": 56.04,
      "end_time": 60.800000000000004,
      "text": "The build, though, is a win. It's thinner, for starters. About 2 millimeters thinner when folded up.",
      "duration": 4.76,
      "raw_segment_count": 3,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1322,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 13,
      "start_time": 60.900000000000006,
      "end_time": 65.0,
      "text": "But the best part of this is how they've achieved that thinness. It's a new hinge.",
      "duration": 4.1,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1466,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 14,
      "start_time": 65.12,
      "end_time": 70.7,
      "text": "One that, for the very first time on a Samsung Flip, can, praise the Lord, close without a gap.",
      "duration": 5.58,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1466,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 15,
      "start_time": 70.88,
      "end_time": 75.48,
      "text": "Well, there is a tiny little hole here, but it's basically gapless. And this is a big deal.",
      "duration": 4.6,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1466,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 16,
      "start_time": 75.78,
      "end_time": 79.96000000000001,
      "text": "Because it's not just that it looks better, and it's a less weird shape, and it takes up less space,",
      "duration": 4.18,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1466,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 17,
      "start_time": 79.96,
      "end_time": 85.39999999999999,
      "text": "but it also creates less room for rogue particles and pocket dust to just find their way inside.",
      "duration": 5.44,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0939,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 18,
      "start_time": 85.61999999999999,
      "end_time": 89.24,
      "text": "Which, trust me, use any folding phone for a period of time is a problem,",
      "duration": 3.62,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0939,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 19,
      "start_time": 89.44,
      "end_time": 93.38,
      "text": "and is probably also one of the main causes of you just ending up with a scuffed inner screen,",
      "duration": 3.94,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0939,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 20,
      "start_time": 93.46,
      "end_time": 99.67999999999999,
      "text": "no matter how careful you think you're being. Speaking of which, this inner screen is now 25% more resistant to scratches.",
      "duration": 6.22,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0939,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 21,
      "start_time": 99.68,
      "end_time": 103.44000000000001,
      "text": "And the outer body is protected by Arma Aluminium and Gorilla Glass Victus 2,",
      "duration": 3.76,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.096,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 22,
      "start_time": 103.66000000000001,
      "end_time": 110.44000000000001,
      "text": "which, I'm told, has the strength of ceramic. Which is pretty cool, considering that ceramic has long been reserved for the highest-end luxury phones",
      "duration": 6.78,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.096,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 23,
      "start_time": 110.44000000000001,
      "end_time": 115.66000000000001,
      "text": "because of its scratch resistance. Only thing I don't like, and this has kind of been an ongoing pet peeve of mine,",
      "duration": 5.22,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.096,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 24,
      "start_time": 115.74000000000001,
      "end_time": 119.46000000000001,
      "text": "is that when you open the phone, it doesn't snap into that fully open position.",
      "duration": 3.72,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.096,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 25,
      "start_time": 119.72,
      "end_time": 124.84,
      "text": "It's still just like a tiny bit flaccid, which also means a tiny bit bent.",
      "duration": 5.12,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.096,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 26,
      "start_time": 124.84,
      "end_time": 130.34,
      "text": "They really should make it so that opening it feels just as tactile and satisfying as closing it,",
      "duration": 5.5,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.098,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 27,
      "start_time": 130.58,
      "end_time": 134.96,
      "text": "because that is fun. But then, the screen is, I would say, not just a big jump,",
      "duration": 4.38,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.098,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 28,
      "start_time": 135.12,
      "end_time": 139.28,
      "text": "but the biggest jump since the very first flip. Specifically, this cover screen.",
      "duration": 4.16,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.098,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 29,
      "start_time": 139.52,
      "end_time": 143.22,
      "text": "I mean, just compared to Samsung's last phone, it is 278% bigger.",
      "duration": 3.7,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.098,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 30,
      "start_time": 143.44,
      "end_time": 146.64000000000001,
      "text": "It now looks like a folder, and it can do a lot more.",
      "duration": 3.2,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.098,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 31,
      "start_time": 146.8,
      "end_time": 151.04,
      "text": "You used to be able to have a peek at your notifications, check your calendar, and make a quick voice recording,",
      "duration": 4.24,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.098,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 32,
      "start_time": 151.04,
      "end_time": 154.98,
      "text": "but we're talking like 10, 20% of the overall functionality of a phone.",
      "duration": 3.94,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 33,
      "start_time": 155.23999999999998,
      "end_time": 161.5,
      "text": "Now, I'd call it 50. There's 13 different widgets available at launch, and they say there's more on their way.",
      "duration": 6.26,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 34,
      "start_time": 161.62,
      "end_time": 166.16,
      "text": "And essentially, each one is its own home screen. You swipe between them, and if you want to move quickly,",
      "duration": 4.54,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 35,
      "start_time": 166.29999999999998,
      "end_time": 170.16,
      "text": "you pinch out and you pick the one you want. Plus, you can swipe to the left to check your notifications,",
      "duration": 3.86,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 36,
      "start_time": 170.42,
      "end_time": 175.42,
      "text": "and down to fiddle with quick settings. It's all very smooth and slick for what is effectively a secondary,",
      "duration": 5.0,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1139,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 37,
      "start_time": 175.72,
      "end_time": 181.02,
      "text": "custom operating system on the same phone. And the other thing that I'm noticing about the way this whole thing is being framed",
      "duration": 5.3,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1172,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 38,
      "start_time": 181.02,
      "end_time": 187.42000000000002,
      "text": "is that it's all about the personality. Samsung's not really trying to pitch this front screen as a way to quickly check things.",
      "duration": 6.4,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1193,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 39,
      "start_time": 187.74,
      "end_time": 192.26,
      "text": "It's more as a tool for self-expression. And that, it achieves.",
      "duration": 4.52,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1193,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 40,
      "start_time": 192.46,
      "end_time": 197.26,
      "text": "I actually cannot believe how much you can customize it. Everything from the battery percentage indicator,",
      "duration": 4.8,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1193,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 41,
      "start_time": 197.5,
      "end_time": 201.14000000000001,
      "text": "to how to display notifications, to the exact shade of color that you want,",
      "duration": 3.64,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1193,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 42,
      "start_time": 201.26,
      "end_time": 205.94,
      "text": "and in what way it fades to another color. You could absolutely lose yourself in it.",
      "duration": 4.68,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1193,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 43,
      "start_time": 205.94,
      "end_time": 212.4,
      "text": "And I plan to do exactly that. Side note, you can also see how much Samsung is pushing this whole fashion angle here,",
      "duration": 6.46,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 44,
      "start_time": 212.5,
      "end_time": 217.16,
      "text": "with the sheer number of cases being offered, including these rather fancy smart ones that, when applied,",
      "duration": 4.66,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 45,
      "start_time": 217.35999999999999,
      "end_time": 221.14,
      "text": "will sync the wallpaper on your phone and even your Galaxy Watch to match.",
      "duration": 3.78,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 46,
      "start_time": 221.28,
      "end_time": 227.04,
      "text": "Plus, you can now use apps on the front. Not all apps, which Samsung could have allowed you to do,",
      "duration": 5.76,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 47,
      "start_time": 227.16,
      "end_time": 230.34,
      "text": "but I guess they want you to only use the apps that have been specifically optimized",
      "duration": 3.18,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 48,
      "start_time": 230.34,
      "end_time": 235.16,
      "text": "to make the most of this strange folder-like shape. So, there's only like 10 at launch.",
      "duration": 4.82,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1107,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 49,
      "start_time": 235.16,
      "end_time": 239.29999999999998,
      "text": "The screen is now big enough, though, to get a full QWERTY keyboard on, which means you can also message.",
      "duration": 4.14,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1345,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 50,
      "start_time": 239.7,
      "end_time": 245.2,
      "text": "It's a little fiddly, but completely usable with one hand, which is a luxury that I'd almost forgotten was even possible.",
      "duration": 5.5,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1345,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 51,
      "start_time": 245.76,
      "end_time": 249.28,
      "text": "Okay, there's a couple of things that I don't like. Not you.",
      "duration": 3.52,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1345,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 52,
      "start_time": 249.74,
      "end_time": 253.96,
      "text": "I'm so sorry. Milo's been replaced by his chunkier London counterpart.",
      "duration": 4.22,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1345,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 53,
      "start_time": 254.68,
      "end_time": 258.76,
      "text": "There's still a crease on this main display. They say it's improved, but it's still very noticeable.",
      "duration": 4.08,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1345,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 54,
      "start_time": 258.96,
      "end_time": 264.08,
      "text": "And I just think it doesn't exactly scream, hey, I'm a market-leading fifth-generation product.",
      "duration": 5.12,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1345,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 55,
      "start_time": 264.08,
      "end_time": 267.12,
      "text": "And then while this inner panel is a 120Hz display",
      "duration": 3.04,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0898,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 56,
      "start_time": 267.12,
      "end_time": 273.28,
      "text": "that can ramp its refresh rate all the way down to 1Hz, the cover screen, which is my other gripe, is locked at 60.",
      "duration": 6.16,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0898,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 57,
      "start_time": 273.41999999999996,
      "end_time": 277.7,
      "text": "And so what this means is that even when you're trying to use it in this super low-power, always-on state,",
      "duration": 4.28,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0898,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 58,
      "start_time": 277.84,
      "end_time": 281.08,
      "text": "this screen is refreshing like 60 times more than it needs to.",
      "duration": 3.24,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0898,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 59,
      "start_time": 281.26,
      "end_time": 286.18,
      "text": "So, it wastes battery. There's an upgraded chip, the Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy,",
      "duration": 4.92,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0898,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 60,
      "start_time": 286.44,
      "end_time": 290.09999999999997,
      "text": "which is basically the same Snapdragon chip you see in all top-end Android phones this year,",
      "duration": 3.66,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.0898,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
